    <mxCell id="caption" value="Long-term memory outlives the feature; short-term working memory lives in .scratch/ and is discarded after merge. The implementer reads records and specs but never edits long-term memory — gaps route back to the owning agent." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#9AA5B1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
